{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat02_title", "source_sha256": "d9a6c3b763801c67ad9ab64ca77737bc0a6d2d79f9ae3d724ba8e8ea89ffda77", "ja": "まつりとおでかけ2", "zh": "和茉莉外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4e2fb1b93745d19a7d4fc848c8a223ac3d344897c7ab73531679ce5df9e16cc1", "ja": "まつりとおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和茉莉一起外出的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "962c6cee98d4d91974460e8f75d4ca9059cb5da01989cc9e29a7a06eef30abee", "ja": "（佐賀での営業回りの合間に、唐津に出かけた。\nまつりも、束の間の観光を楽しんでいるみたいだ）", "zh": "（在佐贺跑营业活动的间隙，去了趟唐津。看来小祭也很享受这短暂的观光时光）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat02_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "30d4c67e9fb92f1d7c4243ec7ddc7708ff304d0cbfcb3c4a144a017982ce5ed3", "ja": "はいほー！　見渡す限りの松原の眺めが、\nとっても素敵だったのです♪", "zh": "嗨呵——！一望无际的松林景色，真是太棒了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat02_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "5ce90e39ed59feb00ed08a57a696ae152384e946e83e1ea4ba7664390368b7a9", "ja": "港で頂いたごはんも、お魚のコロッケや\nイカのシュウマイがとってもおいしかったのですよ。", "zh": "在港口吃到的饭菜也很好吃，鱼肉可乐饼和鱿鱼烧卖都特别美味哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "337165919acf9ad48d4fa90dd1c44cff572cc8c8e5788b42a223e1d2a06f7426", "ja": "唐津焼の工房での、焼き物体験も良かったよな。", "zh": "在唐津烧工坊体验烧制陶瓷也挺不错的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat02_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "f46e89701c909dea59e0d2f74ae66cfa9518806d75381f3a917e1c8eb0fba216", "ja": "お皿の絵付け、とってもわんだほー！でした。\n焼きあがりが今から楽しみなのです～。", "zh": "给盘子彩绘，真是太棒了！  \n现在就开始期待烧制完成的成品了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7b053122a9e38e0dec305e3300b854b4d7d4c1a657a324752a4c673de72f2f86", "ja": "焼いた皿が仕上がって手元に届くまで、数か月か……\n待ち遠しいな。まつりは、何の絵を描いたんだ？", "zh": "烧好的盘子做好后送到手上，还得等上几个月吗……真让人等不及。茉莉画的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat02_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "9eac549811f744860dff4dc1544bbec730eed4740ccac486fd3632fcb52fc9dc", "ja": "劇場のみんなと、お城なのです。うまくできたら、\n{$P$}さんにも見せてあげるのです。", "zh": "是剧场的大家和城堡哦。要是能做得漂亮，也给{$P$}先生先生看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "48e2dd219967e63e5d8930462a7e77d03d94035cb306164bf4cc3a88a6630aa0", "ja": "楽しみにしてるよ。おっと、そろそろ宿に戻る時間だ。\n他に、寄っておきたいところはあるか？", "zh": "我很期待哦。哎呀，差不多该回旅馆了。还有想顺便去看看的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat02_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "672669a9050de478212ca4eaa11b041107a16d6f6127777b8fe17b113811db7a", "ja": "この近くに、ナゴヤというお城があったのです！\n今はお城の跡と、博物館みたいですけど……。", "zh": "这附近曾经有一座叫作名护屋的城哦！现在好像只剩下城址和博物馆了，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6960159b2ec340b5e285c293585dd122d53674b82865cfc21adf73cfb06386b0", "ja": "名護屋城跡だな。戦国時代の、巨大な城だ。\n当時は大都市だったらしい。", "zh": "是名护屋城遗址吧。那是战国时代的一座巨大城堡。\n据说在当时算是一座大都市。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat02_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "000fcf9233c829617afde386ce460ae16eb010075edfc09d378b338ff5716c95", "ja": "お城の名前に、不思議な巡りあわせを感じるのです。\n……またいつか、来てみたいのです。", "zh": "我从这座城的名字中感受到了奇妙的缘分。\n……以后有机会的话，还想再来看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
